   诺亚庄\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          园\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          位于洛哈省的卡塔马约镇，\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          属于\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Grupo CVM\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          （CVM集团公司），\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          成立于2018年，当时的想法是能够在洛哈区域\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          种植\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          精品咖啡，梦想能够将独特国家的差异化咖啡出口到许多国家。\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          CVM\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          的合作伙伴是外国人，他们从哥伦比亚带来\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          了种\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          子，如Gesha Verde，Gesha Amarillo，乌什乌什Wushwush\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          ，SL-28和改良的Typica和波旁品种\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          。\n         </span>\n<span style='background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Rk5M6XwNLBjvVwia6zHEia1UFffrZFeGUkrAlsjicnfeGFrs9QqcwA7CcynibTXWmBxbJUtk8I6xcHvg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Rk5M6XwNLBjvVwia6zHEia1Um59fgeoAxD3iaeJ1SbibGUmWL5nhWtvRRhnmvZKqDoIMiaRCiaY8zXibBibA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<strong style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1px;text-decoration-style: solid;text-decoration-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n           获得奖项\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1px;text-decoration-style: solid;text-decoration-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          2021年Taza Dorada 第三名\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1px;text-decoration-style: solid;text-decoration-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          2022年CoE 第二名和第四名\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSyste